      "value": "Do note that canny posts that are about features that aren’t on Live but in Open Beta won’t be marked as complete until after release. But it can be marked as available in feature release.\n\nAlso, you *can* mention staff in comments and they will get notifications on it. Example; @{5f3287055bc2dc276e0f1630|full_name}",
