      "value": "@{5f3287055bc2dc276e0f1630|full_name}: unfortunately it’s not up to VRChat on the permissions that would allow users to mark their own posts when it comes to Canny. It’s either not allow or allow All statuses. And Canny is very slow when it comes to adding features. 😅\n\nThere are ways that VRChat could do it via API, but ofc that would require time to develop and such. \n\nBut some official means from VRChat to better help track or allow users to help with tracking would be nice 😊",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
